<main class="zd-gg-page">

  <section class="zd-gg-hero">
    <div class="zd-gg-hero__copy">
      <p class="zd-gg-eyebrow">Flagship project</p>

      <h1>Goal Grower</h1>

      <p>
        A goal and habit tracking app where your progress grows visually.
        Build consistency, invite accountability, and turn personal growth
        into something you can actually see.
      </p>

      <div class="zd-gg-actions">
        <a href="#waitlist" class="zd-gg-btn zd-gg-btn--primary">Join Waitlist</a>
        <a href="/pages/support" class="zd-gg-btn zd-gg-btn--secondary">Support This Project</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-gg-hero__visual">
      {% if section.settings.hero_image %}
        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.hero_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
          alt="Goal Grower app preview"
          width="1200"
          height="900"
          loading="eager"
        >
      {% else %}
        {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'zd-gg-placeholder' }}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-gg-problem">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-gg-eyebrow">The problem</p>
      <h2>Most goal apps track progress, but they do not make growth feel alive.</h2>
    </div>

    <p>
      People start with motivation, but lose momentum when goals feel abstract,
      lonely, or hidden inside boring checklists. Goal Grower is built to make
      progress more visible, emotional, and connected to real life.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-gg-features">
    <div class="zd-gg-section-head">
      <p class="zd-gg-eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2>Growth becomes visible.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-gg-feature-grid">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Create a goal</h3>
        <p>Set a meaningful goal with a clear habit, target, or daily action.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Plant it</h3>
        <p>Each goal becomes a visual plant that represents your progress.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Log progress</h3>
        <p>Track completion, quantity, notes, and streaks over time.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Grow together</h3>
        <p>Share accountability with friends or family through shared gardens.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-gg-showcase">
    <div class="zd-gg-showcase__image">
      {% if section.settings.showcase_image %}
        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.showcase_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
          alt="Goal Grower features"
          width="1200"
          height="850"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      {% else %}
        {{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'zd-gg-placeholder' }}
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="zd-gg-showcase__copy">
      <p class="zd-gg-eyebrow">Core experience</p>
      <h2>Your garden becomes a reflection of your life.</h2>
      <p>
        Instead of opening an app just to check boxes, users return to see what
        their consistency is becoming. Every plant, garden, and growth state
        represents effort over time.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Visual progress gardens</li>
        <li>Daily goal logging</li>
        <li>Habit streaks and reflection</li>
        <li>Shared accountability</li>
        <li>Private and public goal options</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-gg-roadmap">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-gg-eyebrow">Roadmap</p>
      <h2>What is being built first.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-gg-roadmap-grid">
      <article>
        <span>Phase 1</span>
        <h3>Core goal tracking</h3>
        <p>Create goals, log daily progress, and view plant growth states.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Phase 2</span>
        <h3>Accountability</h3>
        <p>Invite accountability partners and share selected goal progress.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Phase 3</span>
        <h3>Shared gardens</h3>
        <p>Build shared spaces where friends and family can grow together.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Phase 4</span>
        <h3>Public launch</h3>
        <p>Open the app to early users, testers, and supporters.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-gg-support">
    <div>
      <p class="zd-gg-eyebrow">Why support matters</p>
      <h2>Help Goal Grower become a real app.</h2>
      <p>
        Support helps fund development tools, design work, testing,
        hosting, assets, and the time needed to turn the prototype into
        a polished product.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/support" class="zd-gg-btn zd-gg-btn--light">Support the Mission</a>
  </section>

  <section id="waitlist" class="zd-gg-waitlist">
    <p class="zd-gg-eyebrow">Early access</p>
    <h2>Join the Goal Grower waitlist.</h2>
    <p>Get updates, beta access opportunities, and launch news.</p>

    {% form 'customer', class: 'zd-gg-form' %}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter, goal-grower-waitlist">

      <input
        type="email"
        name="contact[email]"
        placeholder="Email address"
        required
      >

      <button type="submit">Join Waitlist</button>
    {% endform %}
  </section>

</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Page",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "hero_image",
      "label": "Hero image"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "showcase_image",
      "label": "Showcase image"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Goal Grower Page"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}